     - arm_link_2: 1.4 kg (increased from 0.370 kg - motor + link mass)
     - arm_link_3: 1.1 kg (increased from 0.729 kg - adjusted for motor)
     
  3. JOINT LIMITS (Aligned with recomoProto1):
     - arm_joint_1 (yaw): ±180° (±3.1416 rad), effort=30 N·m, velocity=0.5 rad/s
     - arm_joint_2 (pitch): ±90° (±1.5708 rad), effort=30 N·m, velocity=0.5 rad/s
     - arm_joint_3 (elbow): ±90° (±1.5708 rad), effort=30 N·m, velocity=0.5 rad/s
     - arm_joint_4 (gimbal yaw): ±180° (±3.1416 rad), effort=10 N·m, velocity=0.5 rad/s
